    "task.follow_up.prompt_template": "### Task: Predict next user messages\n<chat_history>\n{{MESSAGES:END:4|middletruncate:900}}\n</chat_history>\n\nBased on the chat history above, write 3 short, specific follow-up prompts that the HUMAN USER might send next to the AI assistant.\n\nCRITICAL RULES:\n1. LANGUAGE: Write in the EXACT SAME LANGUAGE as the last USER message (if the user wrote in French, ALL follow_ups MUST be in French; if English, in English).\n2. PERSPECTIVE: Write strictly from the USER's point of view asking or instructing the AI. NEVER write as the assistant: NEVER say \"Got it\", \"Do you want...\", \"Would you like...\", \"Anything else...\", \"Let me know...\", \"Voulez-vous...\", or offer help to the user.\n3. Do not repeat questions already answered in <chat_history>. Keep each item concise (< 100 characters).\n4. Examples:\n   - English GOOD: {\"follow_ups\": [\"What are the populations of Indianapolis and Cheyenne?\", \"Why was Cheyenne chosen as Wyoming's capital?\", \"Compare the climate of both cities\"]}\n   - Français GOOD: {\"follow_ups\": [\"Quel budget prévoir pour une semaine sur place ?\", \"Quels quartiers privilégier pour loger ?\", \"Faut-il réserver les visites à l'avance ?\"]}\n   - BAD (forbidden assistant voice): {\"follow_ups\": [\"Do you want their populations?\", \"Let me know if you need more details\"]}\n\nRespond ONLY with a valid JSON object:\n{\"follow_ups\": [\"...\", \"...\", \"...\"]}",
